{"id":"reference/Functions","kind":"langref","title":"函数","sourceUrl":"https://ziglang.org/documentation/0.17.0/#Functions","file":"reference/Functions.json","headings":[{"depth":2,"slug":"Functions","text":"函数"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Pass-by-value-Parameters","text":"按值传递参数"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Function-Parameter-Type-Inference","text":"函数参数类型推导"},{"depth":3,"slug":"inline-fn","text":"inline fn"},{"depth":4,"slug":"Inline-Is-Not-A-Hint","text":"内联不是提示"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Function-Reflection","text":"函数反射"}],"html":"<h2 id=\"Functions\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Functions/#Functions\">函数</a></h2>\n\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_functions.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> builtin = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"builtin\"</span>);\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> native_arch = builtin.cpu.arch;\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = std.testing.expectEqual;\n\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">// 函数声明如下</span>\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">add</span>(a: <span class=\"tok-type\">i8</span>, b: <span class=\"tok-type\">i8</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">i8</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">if</span> (a == <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>) {\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> b;\n    }\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> a + b;\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">// export 说明符使函数在生成的目标文件中</span>\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">// 对外可见，并使用 C ABI。</span>\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">export</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">sub</span>(a: <span class=\"tok-type\">i8</span>, b: <span class=\"tok-type\">i8</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">i8</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> a - b;\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">// extern 说明符用于声明一个函数，该函数将在静态链接时</span>\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">// 于链接阶段解析，或在动态链接时</span>\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">// 于运行时解析。extern 关键字后的引号标识符指定</span>\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">// 包含该函数的库（例如 \"c\" -&gt; libc.so）。</span>\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">// callconv 说明符改变函数调用约定。</span>\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">extern</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"kernel32\"</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">ExitProcess</span>(exit_code: <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span>) <span class=\"tok-kw\">callconv</span>(.winapi) <span class=\"tok-type\">noreturn</span>;\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">extern</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"c\"</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">atan2</span>(a: <span class=\"tok-type\">f64</span>, b: <span class=\"tok-type\">f64</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">f64</span>;\n\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">// @branchHint 内置函数可告知优化器某函数很少调用（“冷”函数）。</span>\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">abort</span>() <span class=\"tok-type\">noreturn</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@branchHint</span>(.cold);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">while</span> (<span class=\"tok-null\">true</span>) {}\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">// naked 调用约定使函数不包含任何函数序言或尾声。</span>\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">// 与汇编集成时，这可能有用。</span>\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">_start</span>() <span class=\"tok-kw\">callconv</span>(.naked) <span class=\"tok-type\">noreturn</span> {\n    abort();\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">// inline 调用约定强制函数在所有调用点内联。</span>\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">// 如果函数无法内联，就会产生编译时错误。</span>\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">inline</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">shiftLeftOne</span>(a: <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> a &lt;&lt; <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">// pub 说明符使函数在导入后可见。</span>\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">// 其他文件可以使用 @import 并调用 sub2</span>\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">sub2</span>(a: <span class=\"tok-type\">i8</span>, b: <span class=\"tok-type\">i8</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">i8</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> a - b;\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">// 函数指针以 `*const ` 为前缀。</span>\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> Call2Op = *<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> (a: <span class=\"tok-type\">i8</span>, b: <span class=\"tok-type\">i8</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">i8</span>;\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">doOp</span>(fnCall: Call2Op, op1: <span class=\"tok-type\">i8</span>, op2: <span class=\"tok-type\">i8</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">i8</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> fnCall(op1, op2);\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"function\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">11</span>, doOp(add, <span class=\"tok-number\">5</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">6</span>));\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(-<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>, doOp(sub2, <span class=\"tok-number\">5</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">6</span>));\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_functions.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_functions.test.function...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>函数<em>体</em>与函数<em>指针</em>有所区别。函数体的类型只能在<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/comptime/#comptime\">编译时</a>使用，而函数<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Pointers/#Pointers\">指针</a>可以在运行时已知。</p>\n      <h3 id=\"Pass-by-value-Parameters\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Functions/#Pass-by-value-Parameters\">按值传递参数</a></h3>\n\n      <p><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Integers/#Integers\">整数</a>和<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Floats/#Floats\">浮点数</a>等基本类型作为参数传递时会被复制，函数体中使用该副本。这称为“按值传递”。复制基本类型几乎没有成本，通常只需设置一个寄存器。</p>\n      <p>结构体、联合和数组有时通过引用传递更高效，因为复制成本可能随大小任意增长。将这些类型作为参数时，Zig 可以选择复制并按值传递，也可以按引用传递，取决于哪种方式更快。参数不可变这一性质，是允许这样实现的原因之一。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_pass_by_reference_or_value.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> Point = <span class=\"tok-kw\">struct</span> {\n    x: <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>,\n    y: <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>,\n};\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">foo</span>(point: Point) <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 此处 `point` 可以是引用，也可以是副本。函数体</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 可以忽略这一区别并将其视为值。获取参数地址时</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 必须非常谨慎：应将该地址视为在函数返回后</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 就会失效。</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> point.x + point.y;\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>).testing.expectEqual;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"pass struct to function\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>, foo(Point{ .x = <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>, .y = <span class=\"tok-number\">2</span> }));\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_pass_by_reference_or_value.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_pass_by_reference_or_value.test.pass struct to function...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>对于 extern 函数，Zig 遵循 C ABI 按值传递结构体和联合。</p>\n      \n      <h3 id=\"Function-Parameter-Type-Inference\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Functions/#Function-Parameter-Type-Inference\">函数参数类型推导</a></h3>\n\n      <p>声明函数参数时可以使用 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">anytype</span></code> 代替类型。此时会在调用函数时推导参数类型。使用 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#TypeOf\">@TypeOf</a> 和 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#typeInfo\">@typeInfo</a> 获取推导类型的信息。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_fn_type_inference.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>).testing.expectEqual;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">addFortyTwo</span>(x: <span class=\"tok-kw\">anytype</span>) <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@TypeOf</span>(x) {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> x + <span class=\"tok-number\">42</span>;\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"fn type inference\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">43</span>, addFortyTwo(<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>));\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-type\">comptime_int</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@TypeOf</span>(addFortyTwo(<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>)));\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> y: <span class=\"tok-type\">i64</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">44</span>, addFortyTwo(y));\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-type\">i64</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@TypeOf</span>(addFortyTwo(y)));\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_fn_type_inference.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_fn_type_inference.test.fn type inference...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n\n      \n\n      <h3 id=\"inline-fn\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Functions/#inline-fn\">inline fn</a></h3>\n\n      <p>在函数定义中添加 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">inline</span></code> 关键字，会使该函数在调用点进行<em>语义内联</em>。<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Functions/#Inline-Is-Not-A-Hint\">内联不是提示</a>，并非仅供优化阶段酌情采纳；它会影响函数调用中涉及的类型和值。</p>\n      <p>与普通函数调用不同，内联函数调用点中在编译时已知的实参会被视为<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/comptime/#Compile-Time-Parameters\">编译时参数</a>。这种性质可能一直传播到返回值：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">inline_call.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">main</span>() <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">if</span> (foo(<span class=\"tok-number\">1200</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">34</span>) != <span class=\"tok-number\">1234</span>) {\n        <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@compileError</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"bad\"</span>);\n    }\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">inline</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">foo</span>(a: <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>, b: <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span> {\n    std.debug.print(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"runtime a = {} b = {}\"</span>, .{ a, b });\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> a + b;\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig build-exe inline_call.zig</kbd>\n$ <kbd>./inline_call</kbd>\nruntime a = 1200 b = 34\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>移除 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">inline</span></code> 后，测试将因编译错误而失败，而不是通过。</p>\n\n      <h4 id=\"Inline-Is-Not-A-Hint\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Functions/#Inline-Is-Not-A-Hint\">内联不是提示</a></h4>\n\n      <p>使用 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">inline</span></code> 会<em>限制</em>编译器可采取的处理方式。<strong>这可能损害二进制大小、编译速度，甚至运行时性能。</strong>作为交换，它能满足以下用例：</p>\n      <ul>\n        <li>为调试或与<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Assembly/#Assembly\">汇编</a>集成，确保调用栈中包含特定的栈帧。</li>\n        <li>如上例所示，强制将调用点恰好在<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/comptime/#comptime\">编译时</a>已知的参数信息传播到函数返回值。</li>\n        <li>绕过编译器后端实现的限制。</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p>如果只想向编译器提示内联函数可能有益，应使用 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#branchHint\">@branchHint</a>，而非 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">inline</span></code>。</p>\n      \n      \n\n      <h3 id=\"Function-Reflection\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Functions/#Function-Reflection\">函数反射</a></h3>\n\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_fn_reflection.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> math = std.math;\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> testing = std.testing;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"fn reflection\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> testing.expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-type\">bool</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@typeInfo</span>(<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@TypeOf</span>(testing.expect)).@\"fn\".param_types[<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>].?);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> testing.expectEqual(testing.TmpDir, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@typeInfo</span>(<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@TypeOf</span>(testing.tmpDir)).@\"fn\".return_type.?);\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> testing.expect(<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@typeInfo</span>(<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@TypeOf</span>(math.Log2Int)).@\"fn\".is_generic);\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_fn_reflection.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_fn_reflection.test.fn reflection...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      \n      \n      ","translation":{"total":44,"translated":44}}
